{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useIsRestoring(): boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/IsRestoringProvider.ts#L12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/preact-query/src/IsRestoringProvider.ts:12"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you are using "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PersistQueryClientProvider"},{"type":"text","value":", you can also use the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useIsRestoring"},{"type":"text","value":" hook alongside it to\ncheck if a restore is currently in progress. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":" and friends also check this internally to avoid\nrace conditions between the restore and mounting queries."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" while a persisted client is being restored, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" otherwise."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useIsRestoring(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-query/src/IsRestoringProvider.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/IsRestoringProvider.ts#L12)\n\nIf you are using `PersistQueryClientProvider`, you can also use the `useIsRestoring` hook alongside it to\ncheck if a restore is currently in progress. `useQuery` and friends also check this internally to avoid\nrace conditions between the restore and mounting queries.\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n`true` while a persisted client is being restored, `false` otherwise.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsRestoring\ntitle: useIsRestoring\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useIsRestoring(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-query/src/IsRestoringProvider.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/IsRestoringProvider.ts#L12)\n\nIf you are using `PersistQueryClientProvider`, you can also use the `useIsRestoring` hook alongside it to\ncheck if a restore is currently in progress. `useQuery` and friends also check this internally to avoid\nrace conditions between the restore and mounting queries.\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n`true` while a persisted client is being restored, `false` otherwise.\n"}
